return ['domain'=>'page-builder-sandwich','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'page-builder-sandwich','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-26T12:05:05+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-26T12:05:05+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Page Builder Sandwich','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich','The foundation release of the rebuilt Page Builder Sandwich: a settings and About screen, a footprint-free front-end output layer, and one sample content block.'=>'Fitowar farko ta sabon Page Builder Sandwich da aka sake ginawa: saituna da allon Game da Mu, yadidin fitarwa na gaba mai tsabta ba tare da alamar SEO ba, da kuma tubalin abun ciki guda daya.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'Masu samar da AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Masu yin ChatGPT. Mai kyau a kowane fanni.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Masu yin Claude. Suna da ƙarfi wajen rubutu da kuma yin tunani a hankali.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Samfuran Gemini na Google. Masu sauri da rahusa.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Kamfanin fasahar kere-kere ta Turai mai samfuran da suka yi sauri kuma masu sauƙin kuɗi.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Samfura masu rahusa wadanda suka iya rubutu da lissafi.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Maɓalli guda ɗaya don samfuran daga masu samarwa daban-daban.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Duk wani sabis da ke aiki kamar API na OpenAI, gami da samfurin da ke aiki akan kwamfutarka ko uwar garkenka.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Janar (wanda ake amfani da shi lokacin da babu takamaiman abu da aka saita)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Rubutu da sake rubutu','Translation'=>'Fassara','Code and CSS'=>'Lambar da CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin shiga wannan shafin ba.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Wadannan saitunan suna da alaƙa da kowane plugin da ke amfani da su: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Ana boye mabullan ku a cikin bayanan wannan rukunin yanar gizon kuma ana aika su ne kawai zuwa ga mai ba da sabis ɗin da kuka zaɓa - ba zuwa gare mu ba.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Mataki na 1 na 2: zaɓi mai ba da sabis na AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Kuna kawo naku maɓallin, don haka kuna biyan mai ba da sabis ɗin kai tsaye don abin da kuka yi amfani da shi. Ba ku da tabbas? Ko wanne daga cikin waɗannan yana aiki sosai; za ku iya ƙara wasu a nan gaba.','Next'=>'Na gaba','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Mataki na 2 daga cikin 2: haɗa %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗin da ya dace da OpenAI, wanda ya ƙare da /v1. Ana buƙatar maɓalli ne kawai idan sabis ɗin ya nemi ɗaya.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Buɗe %s sannan ka shiga (ko ka ƙirƙiri sabon ajiya kyauta).','the %s API keys page'=>'shafin maɓallan API na %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli kuma ka kofe shi.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Li manna a kasa sannan ka danna "Ajiye kuma ka gwada". Muna turo karamin buƙatu guda ɗaya don bincika ko yana aiki.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Yawancin masu ba da sabis na buƙatar ƙaramin kuɗi a cikin asusun kafin maɓalli ya yi aiki: %s.','add credit'=>'ƙara bashi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Zabi wani mai ba da sabis daban','Address'=>'Adireshishi','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Maɓallin da aka ajiyewa ya ƙare a…%s — manna sabo don maye gurbinsa','Key (optional)'=>'Maɓalli (zaɓi)','API key'=>'Makullin API','Save and test'=>'Ajiye kuma a gwada','Providers'=>'Masu ba da sabis','Provider'=>'Mai ba da sabis','Status'=>'Matsayi','Key'=>'Maɓalli','Get a key'=>'Samun maɓalli','Test'=>'Gwaji','Remove'=>'Cire','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'An adana ta ta hanyar sabon sigar plugin: sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma sake shigar da mabudin.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin da aka ajiye ba kuma (an canza maɓallin tsaro na shafin yanar gizon). Sake shigar da shi.','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'An haɗa - gwajin ƙarshe ya yi nasara %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Gwajin da ya gabata ya gaza: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'An haɗa — ba a gwada ba tukuna','Which model to use'=>'Wane model din da za a yi amfani da shi','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ ta nuna shawararmu don wannan aikin. Lissafin ya haɗa da kowane samfurin da maɓallinku zai iya amfani da shi, wanda aka karanta kai tsaye daga mai bada sabis.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— An ba da shawarar ga mai bada sabis —','Save models'=>'Ajiye samfura','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sabunta jerin samfuran daga masu samarwa','best quality'=>'mafi kyau','lowest cost'=>'mafi ƙarancin farashi','fastest'=>'mafi sauri','Add a model yourself'=>'Ƙara samfurin da kanka','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'An fitar da sabon samfuri yau? Mannar dainiyan sunansa domin amfani da shi nan take.','Model name'=>'Sunan samfurin','Add model'=>'Ƙara samfuri','Recommended models list'=>'Jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Ba a iya tabbatar da jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar ba, don haka ba a nuna shawarwari ba. Sake shigar da plugin ɗin, ko kuma kunna sabuntawa na yau da kullum a ƙasa.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Jerin da ake amfani da shi an wallafa shi ne a ranar %s. Kowane sabuntawar fasalin yana kawo sabon abu.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Haka zalika, bincika Zinn Digital® sau ɗaya a rana don samun sabon jerin abubuwa.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ana aika da buƙatar saukewa mai sauƙi kawai: babu maɓalli, babu adireshin rukunin yanar gizo, babu komai game da abun ciki naka. Jerin yana da sa hannu, kuma ana watsi da jerin da ya gaza binciken sa hannu.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'An bincika karshe a ranar %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Ajiye, sannan a bincika yanzu idan an kunna','a newer list was installed'=>'an shigar da sabon jerin sunaye','already up to date'=>'an riga an sabunta','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'saukewa ya gaza wajen binciken sa hannu kuma an yi watsi da shi','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Ba za a iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba; jerin na yanzu zai ci gaba da amfani','turned off'=>'an kashe','Open'=>'Buɗe','Check their status page'=>'Bincika shafin yanayin su','Open your billing page'=>'Buɗe shafin kuɗi naka','Open your API keys page'=>'Buɗe shafin maɓallan API naka','Open the AI settings'=>'Buɗe saitunan AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin yin hakan ba.','Unknown provider.'=>'Mai bada sabis da ba a sani ba.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗinku, alal misali http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Wannan bai yi kama da maɓallin API ba. Sake kwafi shi, ba tare da tazara ba.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Da farko ka manna mabudin API ɗinka.','Key removed.'=>'An cire Maɓalli.','Models saved.'=>'An adana samfuran.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Shigar dainiyan sunan samfurin, misali kamar yadda takardun mai bayarwa suka rubuta shi.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'An kara %s. Zabi shi a karkashin "Wane samfurin da za a yi amfani da shi".','Model removed.'=>'An cire samfurin.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Sabuntawa ta kullum a kashe take. Ana amfani da jerin da ya zo tare da plugin ɗin.','Checked: %s.'=>'An bincika: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'An sabunta jerin samfuran.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Wani sabon sigar na ɗaya daga cikin plugins ɗinka ya adana maɓallin AI ɗinka. Sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma ka sake shigar da maɓallin a cikin saitunan AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin AI ɗinka da aka adana ba (an sauya maɓallin tsaron shafin). Sake shigar da shi a cikin saitunan AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a saita AI ba tukuna. Ƙara maɓalli don mai ba da AI a cikin saitunan AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a zaɓi samfurin ba don wannan aikin. Zaɓi ɗaya a cikin saitunan AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba zai yi aiki tare da wannan sigar ta fasahar haɗin gwiwa ba.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya isa ga sabis na AI naka ba. Tabbatar cewa yana aiki kuma ana iya isa ga adireshin sa daga sabar yanar gizon ku (ba za a iya isa ga sabis da ke kan kwamfutarka ba daga shafin da aka karbi bakonci).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya isa ga %s ba. Duba shafin su na matsayi; idan suna aiki, mai masaukin bako naka na iya katse haɗin fita, ko kuma adireshin ba daidai bane.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s ya ce asusunka ba shi da kuɗi ko kuma adadin da ya rage. Ƙara kuɗi ko ɗaga iyakar amfani da shi a cikin asusunka tare da su, sannan ka sake gwadawa.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s bai karɓi maɓallin ku ba. Yana iya zama an rubuta shi ba daidai ba, an soke shi ko kuma ya ƙare. Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli kuma liƙa shi anan.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s ya ki amincewa da wannan buƙatar don maɓallinka. Maɓallin na iya rashin samun damar shiga wannan samfurin ko fasalin, ko kuma asusunka yana buƙatar tabbatarwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a samun samfurin "%1$s" daga %2$s don maɓallin ku. Zaɓi wani samfurin a cikin saitunan AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Tsarin ku na %2$s bai haɗa da samfurin "%1$s" ba. Zaɓi wani samfurin a cikin saitunan AI, ko haɓaka tsarin ku tare da su.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s yana ƙuntata saurin da maɓallin ku zai iya aika buƙatu. Jira minti ɗaya sannan ku ƙara gwadawa, ko ku ɗaga iyakar ƙimar ku tare da su.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s na fuskantar matsaloli a halin yanzu (akwai katsewar sabis ko cunkoso a wurinsu). Babu wata matsala game da saitunanku. Gwada sake yi nan ba da jimawa ba.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Buƙatar AI ta gaza saboda dalilin da ba za mu iya ganewa ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ta ci gaba da faruwa, tuntuɓi sashen goyon baya tare da bayanan da ke ƙasa.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na AI ya ba da amsa a wata sifa da wannan plugin ɗin ba zai iya karantawa ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ta ci gaba da faruwa, zaɓi wani samfurin ko tuntuɓi goyon baya.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Na Musamman (mai jituwa da OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Ajiye mabuɗi don wannan mai samar da sabis ɗin da farko.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Makullin ku yana aiki, amma mai ba da sabis ɗin bai lissafa wani samfurin rubutu ba don shi. Ƙara wani samfurin da kanku a ƙasa.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'An haɗa. %1$s ya/ta amsa ta amfani da %2$s. Abubuwan fasahar AI ɗinka sun shirya don amfani.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Ba a yarda matsayinka na mai amfani ya yi amfani da AI a kan wannan shafin ba. Tambayi mai gudanarwa.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar kasafin kuɗin AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara shi a cikin saitunan AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar buƙatunsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara shi a cikin saitunan AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Amfani da tsada','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Rajistar, iyakoki da izinin matsayi sun shafi AI da ake amfani da su ta hanyar: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kididdigar farashin ta yi kusa da gaskiya ce, an lissafta ta ne daga farashin da aka wallafa; samfurin da ba a san farashinsa ba an lissafta shi a matsayin sifili.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Wannan wata: buƙatun %1$s, kimanin %2$s.','When'=>'Lokaci','Who'=>'Wane','Used for'=>'An yi amfani da shi don','Model'=>'Samfurin','Tokens in / out'=>'Alamomi a ciki / waje','About'=>'Game da Mu','Result'=>'Sakamako','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Ba a yi wata roƙon AI ba tukuna.','Done'=>'An gama','Limits and permissions'=>'Iyakoki da izini','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Iyakokin kashe kuɗi na wata-wata (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Bar shi a bude don babු rashin iyaka. AI zai tsaya na sauran watan da zarar kudin da aka kiyasta sun kai shi.','Monthly request limit'=>'Iyakokin buƙatu na kowane wata','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Bar shi babu komai don babu iyaka.','Who may use AI'=>'Wane ne zai iya amfani da AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Ka cire komai domin barin kowane mutum da zai iya amfani da fasalullukan matosai ya yi amfani da AI. Masu gudanarwa za su iya amfani da shi koyaushe.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Ajiye iyakoki da izini','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'An adana iyaka da izni.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Babu rubutun allo na mai gudanarwa a cikin wannan kwafin na plugin ɗin. Sake shigar da shi daga fakitin da aka fitar.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Wannan allon yana buƙatar JavaScript.','Languages'=>'Harsuna','Upgrade'=>'Haɓaka','Pricing'=>'Farashin kaya','Start Trial'=>'Fara Gwaji','Account'=>'Asusun ajiya','Contact Us'=>'Tuntuɓe Mu','Affiliation'=>'Hadin gwiwa','the kind of softwarePlugin'=>'Fifikal','greetingHey %s,'=>'Sannu %s,','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Yi rijista don karɓar sanarwar imel don sabunta tsaro da abubuwa, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu mahimman bayanan muhalli na WordPress. Wannan zai taimaka mana mu sanya %s ya fi dacewa da rukunin yanar gizon ku kuma ya fi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙatar ya yi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Zabi ka karɓi sanarwar imel don sabunta tsaro & fasali, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu basic WordPress environment info.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Idan ka tsallake wannan, babu damuwa! %1$s zai ci gaba da aiki sosai.','Allow & Continue'=>'Bada dama & Ci gaba','verbSkip'=>'Tsallake','Skipping, please wait'=>'Ana tsallakewa, don Allah a jira','Continue'=>'Ci gaba','Please wait'=>'Don Allah jira','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ana kunnawa','This 